                              "value": 1
                            },
                            "description": {
                              "value": "When you successfully Steal something, observers (creatures other than the creature you stole from) take a \u20132 circumstance penalty to their Perception DCs to detect your theft. Additionally, if you first Create a Diversion using Deception, taking a single Palm an Object or Steal action doesn't end your undetected condition."
